    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm kinda scared to go to the er if it is just stones again. it's so expensive and the last time it was just a stone and they basically sent me home with water and advil. do u think the pulsing could just be my heart beating faster cuz im in pain? like is there any way i can just tell if it's stones or something else at home??",
